# Recorded board <-> host input trace (Firmata 2.5).
# One frame per line; the suite feeds the concatenated stream and polls.
#   90 01 00   DIGITAL_MESSAGE port 0, pin 0 high
#   91 20 00   DIGITAL_MESSAGE port 1, pin 13 high
#   9f 03 00   DIGITAL_MESSAGE port 15, mask 3 (high group bits preserved)
#   e0 2a 00   ANALOG_MESSAGE channel 0 = 42
#   e1 7f 07   ANALOG_MESSAGE channel 1 = 1023
#   e2 00 08   ANALOG_MESSAGE channel 2 = 1024
#   c3 01      REPORT_ANALOG channel 3 enable
#   d2 00      REPORT_DIGITAL port 2 disable
#   f4 0d 01   SET_PIN_MODE pin 13 OUTPUT (loopback decode)
#   f5 0d 01   SET_DIGITAL_PIN_VALUE pin 13 HIGH (loopback decode)
#   ff         SYSTEM_RESET
#   f8         MIDI clock (one-byte realtime; decoded as Other)
#   f0 6b f7   CAPABILITY_QUERY (unknown sysex; decoded as Other)
90 01 00
91 20 00
9f 03 00
e0 2a 00
e1 7f 07
e2 00 08
c3 01
d2 00
f4 0d 01
f5 0d 01
ff
f8
f0 6b f7
